      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-p/q9-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"Dropping from rest through 29.41225 + 2.48 m gives v2 = 2g(31.89225) . = 625.0881 With upwards positive, the displacement to the ground is −2.48 m, so v2 = 24.012 + 2(−9.8)(−2.48) [M1] [M1] [A1] = 625.0881. Thus v ≈25.0 . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
